{"answer_text":"Mobile apps vary a lot: some are full CRMs, others are read-only companions. The ones people rate highly on phones: [1]\n\n- **Northwind CRM Essentials**: Powerful and well supported, though per-seat costs climb quickly past the starter tier. [2]\n- **Sheetly**: The cheapest route: a shared sheet with CRM templates. [3]\n- **Pipewell**: Easy to adopt, but email features cost extra. [4]\n\nIn short, trial Northwind CRM and Sheetly side by side with a real week of deals — the better fit is usually obvious by Friday.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50b8-75d7-9faf-6de29868181b","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0051,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:00:37.450Z","engine":"perplexity","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["best mobile crm app","crm app reviews ios android","simple crm mobile offline"],"latency_ms":4430,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a12333f09a","market_name":"United Kingdom","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[125,138],[402,415]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889f843f0cde","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"alias","name":"Sheetly","name_text":"Sheetly","offsets":[[249,256],[420,427]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"indirect","sentiment":"neutral","sentiment_reason":"Listed factually without praise or criticism."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889b1141e640","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":3,"method":"alias","name":"Pipewell","name_text":"Pipewell","offsets":[[323,331]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."}],"mo